Homepage: https://github.com/dreamlayers/netbsd-mopd
Description: MOP (Maintenance Operation Protocol) loader and tools
 mopd answers MOP load requests from DEC machines and terminal servers booting
 over Ethernet, serving the files in /tftpboot/mop. The tools: mopchk checks a
 load file, mopcopy converts ELF and a.out files to MOP format, mopprobe and
 moptrace watch MOP traffic on the LAN.
 .
 A file is found by the name the client asks for, or by the client's Ethernet
 address in lowercase hex with .SYS appended: 08002b90649f.SYS.

